ss=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/enough-with-the-conventions-already-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://theonyxpath.com/enough-with-the-conventions-already-monday-meeting-notes/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">So now, old-home week in NOLA is over, the summer of conventions has passed, our projects begin to move forward again, and so does </span></span></span><b>Onyx Path</b><span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">. This week, we are putting up for sale one of the </span></span></span><b>Chronicles of Darkness: Dark Eras</b><span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"> chapters as a discrete PoD physical booklet to see if folks would enjoy being able to get physical copies of just the chapters they are most interested in. We\u2019ll be putting up these </span></span></span><b>Dark Eras</b><span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"> chapters when we can, as we see how this experiment goes. This week, it\u2019s </span></span></span><i>A Handful of Dust</i><span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">, the</span></span></span><b>Promethean</b><span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"> Dark Era.</span></span></span> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><br /> <br /> haven't read the era, but it'd be cool if they were updating eras to 2e as they did this, though that might make some of us feel a bit cheated... at least if they didn't offer the backers/buyers a discounted rate... I haven't read a handful of dust, but given the state of promethean at the time I'm going to assume that it may have largely been based on 2e anyways? could be wrong.</span></span></span><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T10:10:14-07:00","id":972583,"title":"","content":"No, it was written long before 2e was firmed up. <br /> <br /> Now, with that said, apart from the fact that the Hollow Lineage has its own breed of associated Pandoran, there's not a heck of a lot that I think would change.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}